[1.48,"o","  2) Vercel AI Gateway (AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY): $0.055 per technology-year · this repo ≈ $0.11 a year, first sync ≈ $0.11 once · slightly less complete: ≈ 93% of the best option's breaking-change flags; ≈ 2 more duplicate records per technology-year\r\n"]
